   "frameId": null,
   "text": "STOP CONDITIONS \u2014 whichever comes first\nmax 6 tool rounds   \u00b7   input tokens would exceed 15k   \u00b7   cumulative cost > tenant ceiling   \u00b7   model calls submit_answer\nOn exhaustion the loop forces submit_answer with what it has. It never returns an unanswered turn and never silently truncates evidence.",
   "originalText": "STOP CONDITIONS \u2014 whichever comes first\nmax 6 tool rounds   \u00b7   input tokens would exceed 15k   \u00b7   cumulative cost > tenant ceiling   \u00b7   model calls submit_answer\nOn exhaustion the loop forces submit_answer with what it has. It never returns an unanswered turn and never silently truncates evidence.",
